{"id":423,"date":"2026-08-14T12:43:44","date_gmt":"2026-08-14T12:43:44","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=423"},"modified":"2026-08-14T13:55:23","modified_gmt":"2026-08-14T13:55:23","slug":"managing-pages-the-navigation-pane","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/page-management\/managing-pages-the-navigation-pane\/","title":{"rendered":"Managing Pages"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Managing Pages<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher makes it easy to structure your document exactly as you need it, whether you are designing a single-page flyer or a multi-page booklet.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-439 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-142557.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"470\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-142557.png 333w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-142557-104x300.png 104w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 163px) 100vw, 163px\" \/>Adding Pages<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-431 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-135958.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"152\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-135958.png 439w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-135958-297x300.png 297w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-135958-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 151px) 100vw, 151px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">New pages can be added to your document in several ways:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click the <strong>Add Page<\/strong> button at the bottom of the left-hand Navigation Pane.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click the blank grey area of the Navigation Pane and choose <strong>Insert Page<\/strong> from the context menu.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click anywhere in the workspace background (outside the page canvas) and choose <strong>Add New Blank Page<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Duplicating, Moving, and Deleting Pages<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-432 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-140317.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-140317.png 431w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-140317-292x300.png 292w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 131px) 100vw, 131px\" \/>Right-clicking on any page thumbnail in the Navigation Pane opens a context menu with the following page management options:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Duplicate Page<\/strong> \u2014 creates an exact copy of the selected page and inserts it directly after it.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Move Page Up \/ Move Page Down<\/strong> \u2014 shifts the page one position in the document order.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Delete Page<\/strong> \u2014 removes the page permanently.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Notes<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">For larger documents, it can be helpful to label individual pages so they are easy to identify without clicking into them. The Page Notes feature lets you attach a short custom identifier to any page.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-433 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-140553.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"144\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-140553.png 427w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-140553-288x300.png 288w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 144px) 100vw, 144px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click a page thumbnail and select <strong>Add Note<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Type a short label (e.g., <em>Front Cover<\/em>, <em>TOC<\/em>, or <em>Back Cover<\/em>).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The note appears directly beneath the page thumbnail in a bold, teal-coloured font.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\"><em>Note: Page Notes are purely for your own organisational use within the editor; they do not affect printed output or exported files.<\/em><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Auto Page Numbering<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-437 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-141817.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-141817.png 438w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-141817-290x300.png 290w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 163px) 100vw, 163px\" \/>For longer documents, Open Publisher provides dynamic page numbering. Navigate to the <strong>Insert<\/strong> ribbon tab and click <strong>Page Number<\/strong>. An element is inserted that automatically displays the correct number and updates itself as you add, remove, or reorder pages in your document.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Managing Pages Open Publisher makes it easy to structure your document exactly as you need it, whether you are designing a single-page flyer or a multi-page booklet. Adding Pages New pages can be added to your document in several ways: Click the Add Page button at the bottom of the left-hand Navigation Pane. Right-click the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":428,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[9],"class_list":["post-423","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-page-management"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/423","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=423"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/423\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":443,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/423\/revisions\/443"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/428"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=423"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=423"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}